# Build context for adapters/harbor/bundles/*/environment/Dockerfile.
#
# `.sealed/` is DELIBERATELY NOT excluded: the trial image needs the heldout
# split in `/task` to grade against. It is stripped from the `/workspace` copy
# inside the Dockerfile instead, which is the only place the two copies differ.
.git/
**/.cache/
artifacts/
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/ui/dist/
**/ui/.vite/
.DS_Store
